em with lots of resources/items to farm for. Get bags so you can increase your inventory capacity to hold more items. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Craft system - craft mighty weapons, armors and items to help you fight enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > City buildings system - buy and upgrade buildings to develop your city to get more gold/resources. <br>Army system - recruit soldiers to help you on your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leaderboards - race to see who can reach the top 3 spots. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expeditions system - embark on expeditions with a chance of successfully finding treasures! <br>Achievements - complete achievements for even more damage.<br>Salvage your resources to use in the trader to buy upgrades.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To develop the game alongside the community so it becomes a game that everyone loving the clicker genre can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Holy Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003730/6d76be8e73b5ad6db59aca61e00845fd227d1a24/header.jpg?t=1755537135","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257039146,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257039146/movie480.mp4?t=1754327573","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257039146/movie_max.mp4?t=1754327573"},"name":"Fantasy Clicker Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257039146/5502f31519e5edac544779ee64958692f81b5412/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754327573","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257039146/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754327573","max":"http://video.akamai